#: ../../dart/user_guide/tutorials.rst:2 4ce47349f87d43969732f5a3209a5168
msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr "튜토리얼"

#: ../../dart/user_guide/tutorials.rst:4 01f6e2f7f37b46579fbcb533f075a5f1
msgid ""
"The purpose of this tutorial is to provide a quick introduction to using "
"DART. We designed many hands-on exercises to make the learning effective "
"and fun. To follow along with this tutorial, first locate the tutorial "
"code in the directory: `tutorials "
"<https://github.com/dartsim/dart/tree/main/tutorials>`_. For each of the "
"four tutorials, we provide the skeleton code as the starting point (e.g. "
"`tutorial_multi_pendulum "
"<https://github.com/dartsim/dart/tree/main/tutorials/tutorial_multi_pendulum>`_)"
" and the final code as the answer to the tutorial (e.g. "
"`tutorial_multi_pendulum_finished "
"<https://github.com/dartsim/dart/tree/main/tutorials/tutorial_multi_pendulum_finished>`_)."
" The examples are based on the DART 6 API maintained on this branch."
msgstr ""
"이 튜토리얼은 DART 사용법을 빠르게 소개합니다. 효과적이고 재미있는 학습을 위해 다양한 실습을 준비했습니다. 튜토리얼을 "
"따라하려면 먼저 `tutorials "
"<https://github.com/dartsim/dart/tree/main/tutorials>`_ 디렉토리에서 코드를 찾으세요. "
"네 가지 튜토리얼마다 시작점인 스켈레톤 코드(예: `tutorial_multi_pendulum "
"<https://github.com/dartsim/dart/tree/main/tutorials/tutorial_multi_pendulum>`_)와"
" 완성된 정답 코드(예: `tutorial_multi_pendulum_finished "
"<https://github.com/dartsim/dart/tree/main/tutorials/tutorial_multi_pendulum_finished>`_)를"
" 제공합니다. 예제는 이 브랜치에서 유지보수하는 DART 6 API를 기반으로 합니다."
